e Factory Co., Ltd.\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </div>\n                                                              <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/logo-netoff-450x161.avif\" alt=\"Rinnet Japan Group Co., Ltd.\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </div>\n                                                              <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/logo_gulliver.svg\" alt=\"Gulliver International Co., Ltd.\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </div>\n                                                              <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/download.png\" alt=\"GABA Co., Ltd.\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </div>\n                                                              <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/ozie_logo.svg\" alt=\"Yanagida Orimono Co., Ltd.\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </div>\n                                                              <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/logo.svg\" alt=\"Gems Engineering Co., Ltd.\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </div>\n                                                              <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/logo-1-1-450x131.png\" alt=\"Extolink Co., Ltd.\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </div>\n                                                              <div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/m-and-a.svg\" alt=\"M&amp;A Capital Partners Co., Ltd.\" loading=\"lazy\">\n              </div>\n                              </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n  </div>\n\n<div class=\"lazyblock-post-block-EcfNz alignfull wp-block-lazyblock-post-block\">  \n\n  <section class=\"pa-post-block pa-reviews-block  l-block\">\n    <div class=\"l-container-fluid\">\n      <hgroup class=\"pa-post-block__title c-title-sec\">\n        <p class=\"c-text--en js-split g-fall-text\">reviews</p>\n        <h2 class=\"c-text--ja\">Customer Interview</h2>\n      </hgroup>\n                    <div class=\"p-archive__list p-reviews-list\">\n                                   <div class=\"p-archive-list__item g-list-fade-in\">\n               <a class=\"p-reviews-card\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/reviews/1309/\">\n                 <div class=\"p-reviews-card__header\">\n                   <div class=\"p-reviews-card__thumbnail\">\n                     <div class=\"u-media\">\n                                                                         <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20260408_010613-450x337.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                            </div>\n                   </div>\n                   <h3 class=\"p-reviews-card__title\">Proposals centered on video delivered a dramatically greater impact, achieving 120% of the target.</h3>\n                 </div>\n                 <div class=\"p-reviews-card__body\">\n                   <p class=\"p-reviews-card__com\"> W2 Co., Ltd.</p>\n                   <p class=\"p-reviews-card__name\"> Marketing Manager Sakura Sasaki</p>\n                 </div>\n               </a>\n             </div>                  </div>\n        <div class=\"pa-post-block__link\">\n          <div class=\"wp-block-button has-arrow-next is-decorated\">\n            <a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button \"\n              href=\"\n                            https://rebooth.co.jp/reviews/               \">\n              View All Customer Interviews\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n          </div>\n  </section></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-video alignfull p-home-video\"><video height=\"1080\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1920 / 1080;\" width=\"1920\" autoplay loop muted src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/event.mp4\" playsinline></video></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"lazyblock-post-block-1C5jM0 alignfull wp-block-lazyblock-post-block\">  \n\n  <section class=\"pa-post-block pa-column-block  l-block\">\n    <div class=\"l-container-fluid\">\n      <hgroup class=\"pa-post-block__title c-title-sec\">\n        <p class=\"c-text--en js-split g-fall-text\">column</p>\n        <h2 class=\"c-text--ja\">Column</h2>\n      </hgroup>\n                    <div class=\"p-archive__list p-column-list\">\n                                  <div class=\"p-archive-list__item g-list-fade-in\">\n              <a class=\"p-column-card\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/exhibition/1632/\">\n                <div class=\"p-column-card__header\">\n                  <div class=\"p-column-card__thumbnail u-media\">\n                                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ART-2026-2605-450x282.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                      </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-column-card__body\">\n                  <div class=\"p-post__date\"><span class=\"p-post-date__year\">2026</span>\n                    <span class=\"p-post-date__date\">11.18</span>\n                  </div>\n                  <h3 class=\"p-column-card__title\">Exhibition Booth Color Strategy | Industry‑Specific and Seasonal Color Use and Color Psychology</h3>\n                                      <div class=\"p-post__cat-list\">\n                      <span class=\"p-post__cat\">Exhibition</span>                    </div>\n                                  </div>\n     